{{!-- Before / after slider (sections/sc-before-after.schema.json, written by _src/build-sc.js) — user 2026-11-20: "a
      before / after you can drag, as shape-curve.com's 'Sculpt Your Curves Without the Struggle'"; restyled 2026-11-20
      on the downloaded original (cooling bodysuit page, _work/capture/cooling section 01) with the user's "Still
      Comfortable Hours Later" review card. Measured there, font = the theme's Poppins, violet #4e35ce = --sc-hl:
        band     soft 120deg gradient (rgba violet / pink tints at .6 on white = 5 / 12 / 13 / 8 % of --sc-hl here),
                 27 px top / bottom + 15 px sides on phones, 36 px + 50 px from 1024 px, content max 1600 px (phones
                 take 3 / 4 of the Space above / below settings: 36 -> 27)
        layout   phones: photos, then heading, check list, review card (24 px apart); 1024 px+: photos | text, 60 px gap,
                 both halves the same width, text centred on the photos
        photos   4:3 frame, square corners, no shadow; BEFORE / AFTER white 700, 16 px (24 px from 1024), 10 px from the
                 bottom corners; line 2 px white; handle 40 px ring (2 px white, blur 7 px behind, shadow 0 0 7 px .35)
                 with two white chevrons
        heading  24 / 36 px 700 #222, line 1.3; the second part (heading_em) in --sc-hl
        list     16 px below; 14 / 16 px italic 500 #222, line 1.5; round check 16 / 20 px in --sc-hl, 8 / 10 px gap,
                 rows 4 / 6 px apart
        review   16 px below; white card, 1 px #ececec, radius 10, padding 16 / 20; 5 green Trustpilot boxes 18 / 20 px
                 (5 px gap); title 18 / 20 px 700 #121212; quote 14 / 16 px (Inter 300 there: Poppins 400 #4d4d4d here);
                 name 12 / 14 px 600, 12 / 16 px above it
      The after picture lies underneath, the before picture on top is cut at --pos. Drag the line (mouse), swipe sideways
      or tap (touch; an up / down swipe still scrolls the page), or move it with the arrow keys (role=slider).
      Mechanism = themes/lunara-black-brixpant/sections/before-after.hbs.
      Live store: the section prints NOTHING until BOTH pictures are set (picked or default_*): a half slider looks
